WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.750
A real user asks the agent to reproduce three video effects on three page headings.

00:03.750 --> 00:07.750
The agent extracts 120 frames and inspects the three motion patterns.

00:07.750 --> 00:11.250
It adds scoped shimmer, hue-cycling and character animations.

00:11.250 --> 00:14.250
Browser captures reveal disappearing text. The agent repairs the shimmer.

00:14.250 --> 00:18.600
Final page recording: the first heading uses a moving shimmer.

00:18.600 --> 00:23.600
The routine heading cycles through hues.

00:23.600 --> 00:28.000
The quotation animates per character. All six strict criteria pass.
